  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "37600138",
      "title": "Using ChatGPT For Building Entire Applications",
      "sourceHash": "fed22ac32c397b6bba2e8af7b01b6d834d76eeae1aa69d4a897bb1b48d3aacf1",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.37,
          "end": 5.52,
          "en": "So how can you use ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.52,
          "end": 7.95,
          "en": "without any programming experience",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.95,
          "end": 11.223,
          "en": "or with only limited programming experience?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.24,
          "end": 13.71,
          "en": "Well, you can of course use it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.71,
          "end": 16.62,
          "en": "to give it certain programming tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.62,
          "end": 21.62,
          "en": "You can tell ChatGPT to create a program that renames files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.56,
          "end": 25.2,
          "en": "or some other kind of utility program.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.2,
          "end": 29.1,
          "en": "You can give ChatGPT basic programming tasks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.1,
          "end": 32.64,
          "en": "For example, you could give ChatGPT the task",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.64,
          "end": 37.64,
          "en": "to scan all files in a given folder and organize those files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 38.58,
          "end": 40.95,
          "en": "into sub folders by type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.95,
          "end": 43.35,
          "en": "Audio files into an audio folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.35,
          "end": 45.42,
          "en": "video files into a video folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 45.42,
          "end": 48.483,
          "en": "and maybe other files into another folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.65,
          "end": 51.72,
          "en": "And you could use a prompt like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.72,
          "end": 53.34,
          "en": "Here I'm assigning a role",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.34,
          "end": 57.36,
          "en": "which probably could also be omitted, but doesn't hurt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.36,
          "end": 59.85,
          "en": "And I'm then giving ChatGPT my goal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.85,
          "end": 63.03,
          "en": "and I'm providing all the extra information it should need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.03,
          "end": 66.99,
          "en": "for achieving that goal and for giving me a good response.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.99,
          "end": 70.86,
          "en": "For example, I'm giving ChatGPT the information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.86,
          "end": 73.923,
          "en": "about which files should go into which folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.06,
          "end": 79.28999999999999,
          "en": "Now, if you send this kind of prompt to ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.28999999999999,
          "end": 82.71000000000001,
          "en": "it typically often tells you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.71000000000001,
          "end": 86.34,
          "en": "that it can't directly execute that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.34,
          "end": 91.28999999999999,
          "en": "but it then also typically gives you some code snippets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.28999999999999,
          "end": 92.49000000000001,
          "en": "that you could use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.49000000000001,
          "end": 94.86,
          "en": "or one code snippet that you could use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.86,
          "end": 99.45,
          "en": "And in most cases, for utility programs like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.45,
          "end": 103.89,
          "en": "it will use Python and Python code as a solution",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.89,
          "end": 107.91,
          "en": "which is a great choice because Python is a simple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.91,
          "end": 111.57,
          "en": "yet powerful programming language that can be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 111.57,
          "end": 115.11,
          "en": "on Windows, macOS, and Linux machines.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 115.11,
          "end": 117.69,
          "en": "So it's very versatile and powerful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 117.69,
          "end": 121.83,
          "en": "and it's great for creating utility programs like this one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 121.83,
          "end": 126.39,
          "en": "And with that, ChatGPT goes ahead and generates some code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 126.39,
          "end": 130.59,
          "en": "And even if you have absolutely no programming experience",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 130.59,
          "end": 133.56,
          "en": "and you therefore don't really understand that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 133.56,
          "end": 137.673,
          "en": "you can of course use that code and simply give it a try.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 139.38,
          "end": 142.89,
          "en": "Chances are high that ChatGPT even tells you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 142.89,
          "end": 147.32999999999998,
          "en": "which extra software you need to install to run that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 147.32999999999998,
          "end": 149.4,
          "en": "and which commands you must execute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 149.4,
          "end": 153.15,
          "en": "before creating that code and then even tells you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 153.15,
          "end": 155.163,
          "en": "how to execute that code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 156.03,
          "end": 159.15,
          "en": "And that then therefore allows you to proceed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 159.15,
          "end": 163.07999999999998,
          "en": "to the next step, which is to execute that program",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 163.07999999999998,
          "end": 165.93,
          "en": "that you received from ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 165.93,
          "end": 168.75,
          "en": "And if it did not give you these instructions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 168.75,
          "end": 171.78,
          "en": "which it gave me here, how to run that code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 171.78,
          "end": 174.45,
          "en": "and that I need to install Python,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 174.45,
          "end": 176.73,
          "en": "you can of course always ask it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 176.73,
          "end": 180.36,
          "en": "How can I execute this code?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 180.36,
          "end": 183.51,
          "en": "You could always send a prompt like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 183.51,
          "end": 188.51,
          "en": "as a follow up message to ChatGPT to receive extra support.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 189.06,
          "end": 190.41,
          "en": "Now, one brief note",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 190.41,
          "end": 194.73,
          "en": "about executing code generated by ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 194.73,
          "end": 199.73,
          "en": "If you have no programming experience, you of course kind of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.86,
          "end": 202.8,
          "en": "have to trust ChatGPT.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 202.8,
          "end": 207.75,
          "en": "And depending on which code you told ChatGPT to generate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 207.75,
          "end": 210.42000000000002,
          "en": "there of course always is the danger",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 210.42000000000002,
          "end": 214.82999999999998,
          "en": "that the code contains a bug or does something unintended.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 214.82999999999998,
          "end": 218.04,
          "en": "And of course it could therefore cause damage.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 218.04,
          "end": 220.77,
          "en": "It could delete files you don't want to delete",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 220.77,
          "end": 222.99,
          "en": "or do things like that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 222.99,
          "end": 226.29,
          "en": "so you should be careful with executing code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 226.29,
          "end": 228.12,
          "en": "you don't understand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 228.12,
          "end": 232.68,
          "en": "This code here which it generated for me here is fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 232.68,
          "end": 234.78,
          "en": "But of course for different programs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 234.78,
          "end": 239.73,
          "en": "and different use cases, that might not always be the case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 239.73,
          "end": 242.22,
          "en": "That's just an extra word of caution,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 242.22,
          "end": 244.56,
          "en": "something to be aware of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 244.56,
          "end": 247.65,
          "en": "It's also worth noting that the code generated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 247.65,
          "end": 252.65,
          "en": "by ChatGPT also quite often contains bugs or errors.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 254.49,
          "end": 257.76,
          "en": "It also often does work, but it's also not to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 257.76,
          "end": 262.23,
          "en": "uncommon to get code that does not work out of the box",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 262.23,
          "end": 265.653,
          "en": "especially if you requested a more complex program.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
